 blind spots, dark architecture, and low-signal networks.\n    - switch \"S Shion / Virus Queen Agent White Ghost Team's hacker and nano-virus controller. She commands programmable nano-swarms through Echo Core signal choreography and treats supply chains, bodies, locks, and machines as infection surfaces.\" [checked]:\n      - generic: S\n      - text: Shion / Virus Queen\n      - generic: Agent\n      - generic: White Ghost Team's hacker and nano-virus controller. She commands programmable nano-swarms through Echo Core signal choreography and treats supply chains, bodies, locks, and machines as infection surfaces.\n    - switch \"Z Zero / White Ghost Agent Captain of CHASER's 7th Mobile Squad, codename White Ghost. She is a first-generation human-machine fusion body with the appearance of an eighteen-year-old girl. Neural Sync lets her read another person's memories and even copy skills through Echo Core synchronization.\" [checked]:\n      - generic: Z\n      - text: Zero / White Ghost\n      - generic: Agent\n      - generic: Captain of CHASER's 7th Mobile Squad, codename White Ghost. She is a first-generation human-machine fusion body with the appearance of an eighteen-year-old girl. Neural Sync lets her read another person's memories and even copy skills through Echo Core synchronization.\n    - switch \"S Shion Agent Shion · 现实职业是跨境电商增长负责人，负责选品、内容、广告、定价、库存、履约和利润；在 ECHO 世界中是后勤分发官 Virus Queen。两种身份共享供应链、资源调度与单位经济模型能力。\" [checked]:\n      - generic: S\n      - text: Shion\n      - generic: Agent\n      - generic: Shion · 现实职业是跨境电商增长负责人，负责选品、内容、广告、定价、库存、履约和利润；在 ECHO 世界中是后勤分发官 Virus Queen。两种身份共享供应链、资源调度与单位经济模型能力。\n    - switch \"固 固件通 Agent 精通微控制器编程，在资源受限的硬件上编写高效可靠的固件代码\" [checked]:\n      - generic: 固\n      - text: 固件通\n      - generic: Agent\n      - generic: 精通微控制器编程，在资源受限的硬件上编写高效可靠的固件代码\n    - switch \"钊 钊审财 · 财报研究员 Agent 行业研究员型散户：把看得懂的行业研究透，季度跟踪、管理层考察、生活体感，永远满仓靠调仓。\" [checked]:\n      - generic: 钊\n      - text: 钊审财 · 财报研究员\n      - generic: Agent\n      - ge